        "parms": "2. Turn it off and turn on the right toggle: the same noise through ~hp at the same cutoff. It keeps what ~lp throws away: at a low cutoff ~lp leaves a rumble and ~hp nearly the whole hiss. Turn on both to hear the two halves together.",
